  internal_calculus normal programme compilation and later source refresh consume the same demand resolver; explicit template address_demands are inherited by reference, with existing capability families resolved when no explicit demand contract overrides them
  internal_calculus existing source, pack, projection, provider and creator descriptors are cut through AddressPlane before any optional residual search; matching a source then rechecks its current published CMS row in the requested namespace
  invariant source discovery cannot mark a requirement met or overwrite accepted evidence; recompilation preserves authored source membership, presentation order, funding scope and completed state
  invariant template_ref names one maintained template rather than copying its demand definition into each instance; candidate_refs and resolved_dependency_refs are non-owning projections
  invariant a changed template or source dependency reaches the existing native FactDelta and MaterialCompiler source-collection handoff; the configured lowerer reruns the existing programme resolver without external discovery and retires the handoff only after successful refresh
  witness scripts/tests/program_resolution_native.test.mjs and scripts/tests/compile_program_fabric.test.mjs pass native-owner, automatic compilation, withdrawal, namespace, accepted-state, capacity, rollback and actual lowerer refresh tests
  known_gap ordinary resolution is bounded to 256 candidates per typed cut and explicit collection limits; it refuses incomplete projections rather than silently narrowing them; nutrition formulation belongs to Recipe and bounded bulk video collection belongs to SourceFrontier; this resolver supplies their owner references rather than accepting or running effects itself
  known_gap active lowerer services must configure the installed programme resolver and Bun runtime; the source and three managed commands were updated, but no public service or standing-worker configuration was restarted in this pass

  source_path scripts/program-workspace-owner.mjs
